::Q008::[markdown]Pick the 1st Principal Part of θάπτω.:{
	~%-100%ἐτάφην#Incorrect. **ἐτάφην** is Principal Part 6 of **θάπτω** “bury” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%ἔθαψα#Incorrect. **ἔθαψα** is Principal Part 3 of **θάπτω** “bury” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%ἐθέλω#Incorrect. **ἐθέλω** is Principal Part 1 of **ἐθέλω** “to be willing” (Chapter 4).
	~%100%θάπτω#Correct: **θάπτω** is the 1st Principal Part of **θάπτω** (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%θάψω#Incorrect. **θάψω** is Principal Part 2 of **θάπτω** “bury” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%τέθαμμαι#Incorrect. **τέθαμμαι** is Principal Part 5 of **θάπτω** “bury” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%τάττω#Incorrect. **τάττω** is Principal Part 1 of **τάττω** “draw up (in battle)” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%παύω#Incorrect. **παύω** is Principal Part 1 of **παύω** “stop” (Chapter 3).
}


::Q009::[markdown]καίτοι:{
	~%-100%in that place#Incorrect. **ἐκεῖ** means “in that place” (Chapter 7).
	~%-100%for (explanatory)#Incorrect. **γάρ** means “for (explanatory)” (Chapter 2).
	~%-100%out of#Incorrect. **ἐκ + gen; ἐξ + gen** means “out of” (Chapter 1).
	~%100%and further#Correct: **καίτοι** → “and further” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%therefore#Incorrect. **οὖν** means “therefore” (Chapter 7).
	~%-100%after#Incorrect. **ἐπεί** means “after” (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%if#Incorrect. **εἰ** means “if” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%or#Incorrect. **ἤ** means “or” (Chapter 2).
}


